Package: vless-router-panel
Version: 1.3.0
Depends: curl, jq, ucode, uhttpd, kmod-nft-tproxy
License: MIT
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Xstrwe <https://github.com/Xstrwe>
Source: https://github.com/Xstrwe/vless-router-panel
Description: Web panel "VLESS на роутере" for OpenWrt (uhttpd :8088).
 Toggle transparent proxy, test connection and speed, save vless://,
 hysteria2://, naive+https:// links and a WireGuard .conf, and
 autoupdate each protocol from its own link (the field under the
 protocol block or the saved connection link). Requires a manually
 installed xray binary in /usr/bin and geoip/geosite in /usr/share/xray.
 hysteria and naive binaries are optional; install naive with /usr/libexec/vless-panel/install-naive.sh.
